{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"Mozilla.Thunderbird.af","latestVersion":"159.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Thunderbird is a free email application that is easy to set up and customize - and it's loaded with great features!","license":"MPL-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Thunderbird is a free email application that is easy to set up and customize - and it's loaded with great features!","license":"MPL-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Thunderbird is a free and open source email, newsfeed, chat, and calendaring client, that’s easy to set up and customize. One of the core principles of Thunderbird is the use and promotion of open standards - this focus is a rejection of our world of closed platforms and services that can’t communicate with each other. We want our users to have freedom and choice in how they communicate.","moniker":"thunderbird","name":"Mozilla Thunderbird (af)","packageUrl":"https://www.thunderbird.net/","publisher":"Mozilla","publisherUrl":"https://www.mozilla.org/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.thunderbird.net/thunderbird/159.0/releasenotes/","tags":["email","mail"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"Thunderbird 是一款免费的邮件应用程序，配置简单、定制自由、功能强大！","license":"MPL-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Thunderbird 是一款免费开源的电子邮件、新闻订阅、即时通信、日历客户端，配置简单，定制自由。Thunderbird 的核心准则之一是使用和推广开放标准——重点就是拒绝世界上我们无法相互通信的封闭平台和服务。我们希望我们的用户在沟通方式上拥有自由和选择。","name":"Mozilla Thunderbird (af)","packageUrl":"https://www.thunderbird.net/zh-CN/","publisher":"Mozilla","publisherUrl":"https://www.mozilla.org/zh-CN/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.thunderbird.net/thunderbird/159.0/releasenotes/","tags":["电子邮件","邮件"]}},"longDescription":"Thunderbird is a free and open source email, newsfeed, chat, and calendaring client, that’s easy to set up and customize. One of the core principles